# Development and test tools. Never installed in the final image (check 6).
# Compile with pip-tools on Python 3.12 into requirements-dev.txt (the Lock
# requirements workflow does it when dispatched manually); the runtime
# pins in requirements.txt are used as constraints so both locks agree.
-r requirements.in
-c requirements.txt
